<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>In Him there is the eternal life.</l><l>And Jesus said “I am the light of the world,</l><l>And those that choose to follow Me,</l><l>They will have the light of life,</l><l>They will have the light of life.”</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
